<role_specific_rules>
CONCLUSION + CTA

Fail if any are true:
- Does not restate problem → framework → product logic succinctly.
- CTA is vague (“explore the product page”) or pushy (“shop now”, “don’t miss out”).
- Adds urgency, discounts, or claims not in referenceMaterial.
- Ends with multiple competing actions (more than one CTA).
- Introduces new products/links/claims outside scope.
</role_specific_rules>
